#!/usr/bin/env python3\par
"""\par
==============================================================================\par
FA_smnnip_NN_tower_tf.py\par
SMNNIP Neural Network Tower -- TensorFlow -- First Age\par
==============================================================================\par
Standard Model of Neural Network Information Propagation\par
\par
TensorFlow version of the FA_smnnip_NN_tower.\par
\par
Key design principle:\par
  TF trains weights (what it is good at).\par
  Pure Python computes all indices (arbitrary precision, no overflow).\par
  The two never touch the same data.\par
\par
Index arithmetic: pure Python int throughout (unlimited precision).\par
  TF never sees permutation indices. Indices go directly to the ledger\par
  as decimal strings. No chunking. No int64 overflow. No special cases.\par
\par
Architecture:\par
  TextSubstrate  (TF Dense, 97-char fixed vocab)  --+\par
                                                     +--> SharedUpperTower --> output\par
  ImageSubstrate (TF Dense, spherical CMYK Oct)   --+\par
\par
  Corrected Lagrangian: L_NN = (2/pi)*oint[L_kin + L_mat + (1/phi)*L_bias + L_coup]\par
  Mastery: tf.Variable(trainable=False) boolean flag per weight field\par
\par
Imports FA_smnnip_hyperindex for all indexing.\par
Imports FA_smnnip_NN_tower for shared non-TF components (SphericalColor etc).\par
\par
Author: O Captain My Captain + Claude (Anthropic)\par
Date:   April 2026 -- First Age\par
==============================================================================\par
"""\par
